### Raw Data
- Trap-level catch data
- Individual crab measurements
- Environmental data per station

### Variables include:
- Species ID
- Sex
- Carapace width (CWspines, CWbase)
- Carapace length (CL)
- Weight (g)
- Reproductive state (ovigerous, prior spawn, ovary stage)
- Station (1–4)
- Quarter (2020–2021)
- Environmental parameters (temperature, salinity, DO, pH, depth)
